B.Nd=new A.aQ(B.cK,["What is Bhagyagastro?","Bhagyagastro is a personalized astrology book service. We create a 194-page book written specifically for you based on your birth chart \u2014 covering your personality, love life, career, and life path."],t.l)
B.Nc=new A.aQ(B.cK,["How is my book personalized?","We analyze the exact position of planets and stars at the moment and location of your birth. Every page is tailored to your unique birth chart \u2014 no two books are the same."],t.l)
B.Na=new A.aQ(B.cK,["How long does delivery take?","Your eBook arrives in your inbox within 24 hours. The paperback typically takes 8\u201316 business days with FREE shipping included."],t.l)
B.Ng=new A.aQ(B.cK,["What's included in the book?","Your book includes: \u2726 Birth chart analysis \u2726 Love & compatibility insights \u2726 Career guidance \u2726 Life path profile \u2726 Crystal recommendations \u2726 Tarot insights \u2726 Astrological events calendar"],t.l)
B.Nf=new A.aQ(B.cK,["Is there a discount available?","Yes! We currently offer 50% off for a limited time. The paperback (\u20b95,000 \u2192 \u20b92,500) and eBook (\u20b91,000 \u2192 \u20b9500) are both discounted. Act fast before the offer expires!"],t.l)
B.Ne=new A.aQ(B.cK,["I'm new to astrology. Is this for me?","Absolutely! We tailor the language to your experience level. If you're a beginner, your book is written in clear, friendly language \u2014 no jargon. Everyone can enjoy and benefit from it."],t.l)
B.Nb=new A.aQ(B.cK,["Can it help with relationships?","Yes! We include detailed compatibility reports, partner matching insights, and guidance on how to build deeper, more meaningful relationships based on your zodiac profile."],t.l)
B.N9=new A.aQ(B.cK,["How do I get started?","Just take our 1-minute quiz on the homepage! Select your gender, answer a few questions, enter your birth details, and your personalized book will be ready. It's that simple \u2726"],t.l)
B.hW=s([B.Nd,B.Nc,B.Na,B.Ng,B.Nf,B.Ne,B.Nb,B.N9],t.SN)
