B.a_F=new A.h5("Sagittarius","\u2650","Nov 22 \u2013 Dec 21","Free-spirited, philosophical, and endlessly optimistic. The whole world is your classroom. Your quest for truth and adventure inspires everyone.","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503435824048-a799a3a84bf7?w=800&h=400&fit=crop","Fire","Jupiter","assets/zodiac/sagittarius.png")
B.a_G=new A.h5("Libra","\u264e","Sep 23 \u2013 Oct 22","Graceful, fair, and magnetically charming. You seek harmony in all things. Your gift for balance and beauty makes you a natural peacemaker.","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1476231682828-37e571bc172f?w=800&h=400&fit=crop","Air","Venus","assets/zodiac/libra.png")
B.a_H=new A.h5("Leo","\u264c","Jul 23 \u2013 Aug 22","Radiant, generous, and born to lead. As a Leo, you carry the sun within you. Your warmth lights up every room and your loyalty is legendary.","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1546182990-dffeafbe841d?w=800&h=400&fit=crop","Fire","Sun","assets/zodiac/leo.png")
B.a_I=new A.h5("Virgo","\u264d","Aug 23 \u2013 Sep 22","Precise, thoughtful, and quietly brilliant. You see what others miss. Your dedication to excellence and your gentle heart make you irreplaceable.","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500534314209-a25ddb2bd429?w=800&h=400&fit=crop","Earth","Mercury","assets/zodiac/virgo.png")
B.a_J=new A.h5("Cancer","\u264b","Jun 21 \u2013 Jul 22","Deeply intuitive and fiercely protective. Your emotional intelligence is your compass. You nurture deeply and your home is your sacred sanctuary.","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507525428034-b723cf961d3e?w=800&h=400&fit=crop","Water","Moon","assets/zodiac/cancer.png")
B.a_K=new A.h5("Taurus","\u2649","Apr 20 \u2013 May 20","Grounded, sensual, and deeply loyal. You build empires slowly and beautifully. Your patience is your superpower and your love is unshakeable.","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441974231531-c6227db76b6e?w=800&h=400&fit=crop","Earth","Venus","assets/zodiac/taurus.png")
B.AV=new A.h5("Capricorn","\u2651","Dec 22 \u2013 Jan 19","Ambitious, disciplined, and built to endure. You climb mountains others dare not dream of. Your resilience and wisdom carve legacies that last generations.","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519681393784-d120267933ba?w=800&h=400&fit=crop","Earth","Saturn","assets/zodiac/capricorn.png")
B.a_L=new A.h5("Aquarius","\u2652","Jan 20 \u2013 Feb 18","Visionary, independent, and ahead of your time. You see the future clearly. Your innovative mind and humanitarian heart make you a catalyst for change.","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1451187580459-43490279c0fa?w=800&h=400&fit=crop","Air","Uranus","assets/zodiac/aquarius.png")
B.a_M=new A.h5("Pisces","\u2653","Feb 19 \u2013 Mar 20","Empathetic, dreamy, and profoundly creative. You feel everything deeply. Your imagination and compassion create a world of beauty that touches all who know you.","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505118380757-91f5f5632de0?w=800&h=400&fit=crop","Water","Neptune","assets/zodiac/pisces.png")
B.a_N=new A.h5("Scorpio","\u264f","Oct 23 \u2013 Nov 21","Intense, magnetic, and profoundly transformative. Your depth is unmatched. You see through illusions and forge connections that transcend the ordinary.","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518837695005-2083093ee35b?w=800&h=400&fit=crop","Water","Pluto","assets/zodiac/scorpio.png")
B.a_O=new A.h5("Aries","\u2648","Mar 21 \u2013 Apr 19","Bold, ambitious, and driven by an unstoppable fire. As an Aries, you leap before you look \u2014 and somehow always land on your feet. Your courage lights the way for others.","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534796636912-3b95b3ab5986?w=800&h=400&fit=crop","Fire","Mars","assets/zodiac/aries.png")
